OL,3,GNEWSANew drones could tackle crime     
OL,4,A'within 30 seconds'                    
OL,6,FNew drones featuring loud speakers and 
OL,7,Fspotlights could be introduced in a    
OL,8,Ftown centre to clamp down on crime.    
OL,10,FIt is hoped the first trial will begin 
OL,11,Fin March 2027, when a drone will be    
OL,12,Fplaced on top of Swindon's fire station
OL,13,Fthat can be deployed to incidents as   
OL,14,Fthey unfold.                           
OL,16,FPhilip Wilkinson OBE, Police and Crime 
OL,17,FCommissioner (PCC) for Wiltshire, said 
OL,18,Fthe drone could "cover anywhere" in the
OL,19,Ftown centre.                           
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
