OL,3,GNEWSANew drones could tackle crime     
OL,4,A'within 30 seconds'                    
OL,6,F"If you can imagine an incident where  
OL,7,Fperhaps somebody is being threatened,  
OL,8,Fprobably within 30 seconds we can have 
OL,9,Fa drone over them with a spotlight on  
OL,10,Fthe potential offender, and talk to    
OL,11,Fthem telling them that their actions   
OL,12,Fare being recorded," he added.         
